# What: Files Git must not track in the extension project: the pulled base model, dependencies,
#     the build archive pushed to the tenant and local credentials.
# Why: [CAP-S09] .base is fetched from the running app with `cds pull` (always the tenant's current
#     model); gen/extension.tgz is rebuilt by every `cds push`.
# If missing or unlinked: A stale base model or credentials in .cdsrc-private.json are committed.
node_modules/
.base/
gen/
.cdsrc-private.json
default-env.json
*.sqlite
.env
